// initialize random number
srand(time(NULL));
numberToGuess = rand() % 10 + 1;

After the random number has been generated (a number from 1 - 10), use some kind of loop to give the user as many guesses as is in the variable numberOfGuesses.  
Use whatever loop you think works best for you.  If the guessed number is too low the program should say "Higher" and if the guessed number is too high the program should say "Lower".  
If the user guesses the number the program should say "Congratulations!" or something like that.  Feel free to prompt the user in your own colorful way.
*/

